# 5.2 voice.listen crashes (exit 101, a panic): captions and act are collateral; listen restarts with the leaf
# backoff (2, 4, 8, 16, 60 s); the 6th crash within 10 min opens the breaker.
start desk voice
at 10 exit voice.listen code=101
at 10 down voice.captions voice.act
expect 11 health voice.captions blocked
expect 13 ran start voice.listen
expect 30 ran start voice.captions
expect 30 ran start voice.act
at 100 exit voice.listen code=101
at 200 exit voice.listen code=101
at 300 exit voice.listen code=101
at 400 exit voice.listen code=101
at 520 exit voice.listen code=101
expect 530 health voice.listen failed
expect 530 notified Voice listener keeps failing
